'''The Face''' (カオル君, '''''Kaoru-kun''''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy first seen as the boss of the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

