|Another Red/Dark variant of Hannya, introduced in the 12th Anniversary as opposed to an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]]. Similar to Hannya, but has lower health and attack power, attacks less frequently and trades Hannya's guaranteed 5-second weaken for a 30% chance of a 3-second freeze.
|Baron Face
|A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of Shy Boy from the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]]. Very similar to The Face, but attacks roughly twice as fast.
|Archbaron Face
|A bigger variant of Baron Face with superior health, damage and range, but a longer attack foreswing, backswing and rate making his attack cycle even slower than The Face's.
|The Golden Face
|A glistening Floating variant with a 30% chance to crit, much higher speed and large stat buffs to make him a relevant threat. Golden Face also gets slightly higher range and a faster attack frequency.
